msgid "Nextcloud refused the app password. Edit this integration and enter a new app password."
msgstr "Server Nextcloud odmítl heslo pro aplikaci. Upravte tuto integraci a zadejte nové heslo pro aplikaci."

#: lib/tymeslot/integrations/video/providers/nextcloud_talk_provider.ex
